00:04:46,666 --> 00:04:52,666
Ever since I was born, I was dope.

2
00:09:33,333 --> 00:09:39,333
Popstar: Never Stop Never Stopping is a comedy,
music film directed by Akiva Schaffer.

3
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:26,000
When his new album fails to sell records, pop/rap superstar Conner4real goes into a
major tailspin and watches his celebrity high life begin to collapse.

4
00:19:06,666 --> 00:19:12,666
He'll try anything to bounce back, anything except
reuniting with his old rap group The Style Boyz.

5
00:23:53,333 --> 00:23:59,333
Conner Friel, played by Andy Samberg.

6
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
Owen Bouchard, played by Jorma Taccone.

7
00:33:26,666 --> 00:33:32,666
Lawrence Dunn, played by Akiva Schaffer.

8
00:38:13,333 --> 00:38:19,333
Paula Klein, played by Sarah Silverman.

9
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:06,000
Harry Duggins, played by Tim Meadows.

10
00:47:46,666 --> 00:47:52,666
Deborah, played by Maya Rudolph.

11
00:52:33,333 --> 00:52:39,333
Popstar: Never Stop Never Stopping is a 2016 American mockumentary musical comedy film directed by Akiva Schaffer
and Jorma Taccone from a screenplay written by and starring Andy Samberg, Taccone, and Schaffer.

12
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
The trio, collectively known as The Lonely Island, also
co-produced the film with Judd Apatow and Rodney Rothman.

13
01:02:06,666 --> 01:02:12,666
Sarah Silverman, Tim Meadows, Imogen Poots, Joan Cusack, Maya
Rudolph, and Chris Redd appear in supporting roles.

14
01:06:53,333 --> 01:06:59,333
The film was released on June 3, 2016, by Universal Pictures, and became a box-office
bomb, grossing just over $9 million against a budget of $20 million.

15
01:11:40,000 --> 01:11:46,000
It received generally positive reviews from critics, and
has since developed a cult following.

16
01:16:26,666 --> 01:16:32,666
The film explores themes of concert, musician,
pop star, celebrity, mockumentary.

17
01:21:13,333 --> 01:21:19,333
The tone is lighthearted.
